This records one reference build. Other targets, linkers, and Cargo homes
produce different hashes. The installer verifies the Source digest, runs
locked release tests and build, and records the installed binary hash and
toolchain in the settings vendor directory's .carr-build.json.
After a source change, refresh this reference build and run
`python3 ops/hxprobe-source-digest.py --write`; CI fails a crate, atlas, or
atlas generator change whose Source digest line is stale.
